                <note rend="inline" type="source">339.3921L96/a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé des Affaires in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Brewer</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-07-30T20:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 30, 1920—8
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>28. Department informed Amerigo Lugo and Fabio Fiallo and other Dominican
                    citizens have been imprisoned by Military Government for infractions of
                    censorship regulations, and that they are being tried by special Court Martial.
                    Advise Department fully at once regarding this case.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
